"## Introduction\n"
"An “And” can be introduced with the §0 theorem. Conjunctions and biconditionals can both be constructed using the angle bracket notation as well.\n"
"### Examples\n"
"§1\n"
"## Elimination\n"
"An “And” like §2 can be reduced in two ways:\n"
"1. Aquire evidence for §3 using §4 or §5\n"
"2. Aquire evidence for §6 using §7 or §8"
