"- §9 — Your invitation for Sybeth is evidence that Sybeth is invited to the party\n"
"# Goal\n"
"Use §10 and §11 to produce evidence that §12. Remember that you use evidence (generally lowercase letters), to deduce new propositions (generally uppercase letters)\n"
"\n"
